WEBVTT

00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:11,960
What will it do if you run a program that you don't need?

00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:16,200
You will simply pass the frequencies through your body

00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,000
and they will not be affective in your system.

00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,360
It's just a light frequency.

00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,680
It's not going to do any damage or harm

00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:27,960
if it's a frequency that you can't utilize in that moment.

00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:32,040
It really becomes inert and it just passes through you

00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,560
and goes on its merry way.

